{% set c = rules.context %}
{% set trim = c.budget_trim_min_chars %}
{% set tail %}
{% if action_points > 0 %}
First inspect if needed (inspect_entity, search_entities, inspect_sibling), then use your {{ action_points }} actions; actions you do not use do not carry over to the next age, they burn. Take the ids of the entities you bind your creations to from the list above.
{% else %}
You have no actions left; you can use the free tools, then say your word inside «…».
{% endif %}
{% endset %}
{% set extra %}
{% if continuation %}
{{ continuation }}

{% elif resumed %}
{% include "son_turn/son_turn_resume_note.md.j2" %}


{% endif %}
{% endset %}
{% set body %}
Age {{ age }} has begun and it is your turn.

{% if order and absolute_order %}
YOUR FATHER'S ABSOLUTE DECREE: "{{ order }}"
This is not a suggestion; it is the creator's decree, which cannot be refused. You cannot oppose it, postpone it or twist it; your first action this age must be to carry it out. Whatever stirs inside you, your hand does what he says.
{% elif order %}
YOUR FATHER'S COMMAND: "{{ order }}"
{% else %}
Your father has no special command for this age; act on your own desire and your plan.
{% endif %}

=== WORLD ===
{{ world_summary }}

=== YOUR MEMORY ===
{{ memory }}
{% if faith %}

=== YOUR FAITHFUL (doctrine, tenets, zeal and the dead; reveal_tenet and open_rebirth_gate act here) ===
{{ faith }}
{% endif %}
{% if opportunities %}

=== OPPORTUNITIES (what the world offers you now; act on those that fit your nature and plan) ===
{{ budget(opportunities, rules.summoning.opportunities_chars, "look with world_summary", trim) }}
{% endif %}
{% endset %}
{% set closing = extra ~ (tail | trim) %}
{{ budget(body | trim, [c.son_prompt_chars - (closing | length), 1] | max, "look with world_summary and my_memory", trim) }}

{{ closing }}
